{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 14, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "世子", "id": "世子"}, {"form": "中國", "id": "中國"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "助", "id": "助"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "喪", "id": "喪"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恆", "id": "恆"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "產", "id": "產"}, {"form": "直", "id": "直"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "變", "id": "變"}, {"form": "貢", "id": "貢"}, {"form": "賈", "id": "賈"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.1124056108004454, "source": "助", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.681021528714291, "source": "助", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.4870990602418561, "source": "中國", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.6877697557040074, "source": "中國", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "中國", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 1.9390841839849136, "source": "中國", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 3.597312260588446, "source": "世子", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.1918471524802814, "source": "變", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 3.1918471524802814, "source": "產", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 4.290459441148391, "source": "產", "target": "恆"}, {"weight": 2.585711348909966, "source": "產", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.585711348909966, "source": "產", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "見", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 3.1918471524802814, "source": "見", "target": "求"}, {"weig